{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(low_on_time)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (low on time)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f7fbfd399817ffc78c526f5668e3315ab3d9e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28d95e9740a33b36b75a1f785d999aefb7c25c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{10}{8} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1\\dfrac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1\\dfrac{3}{12} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1\\dfrac{1}{5} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1\\dfrac{10}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"412\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction in question is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d3560fba12b97d35543b1e1028c14f5f1545b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />.  Expressing all of the choices we have,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12bc58b474869d91326a33d40b0b0a21a8e1ab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1.25 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1.25 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1.25 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1.2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"437\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>It's clear then that choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" /> is the answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28low_on_time.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(low_on_time)\">Solution 2 (low on time)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (low on time)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A quick glance shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" /> is the only answer with a denominator that does not have 4 as a factor, so it is unlikely that it will simplify into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3628e955d7e4a0e6322ada48bc33c003f9b25dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Pro